/-!
# Exceptional characteristic-two automorphism preliminaries

The Tits export proves the innerness part of 16.1.6 for every automorphism
fixing a Sylow two-subgroup pointwise, including on perfect central covers.
It uses the actual Parrott carrier and its certified permutation comparison.

The remaining G₂, genuine triality and Ree involution tables, their fixed
two-residuals and long-root refinements are separate model obligations. This
module does not yet assert the full exceptional cases of 16.1.4 or 16.1.6.

Source: Aschbacher–Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
manuscript of 1 March 2004, printed pp.1170–1173.
-/
